{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:59:55+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HAELE 3D - Portrait Studio Lite - Drawing References", "steam_appid": 2949950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAELE 3D - Portrait Studio Lite is a 3D face drawing reference tool designed for beginners to advanced artists. It includes a diverse range of characters, from simplified models to realistic male and female faces, along with facial expressions, lighting setups, and environments. It serves as a helpful resource for learning how to draw the human head. Whether your art style is realistic, stylized, cartoon, anime, or anything in between, this easy-to-use app complements tutorials and helps you practice portrait drawing or sculpting skills from sketch to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949950/extras/8d5b298df66fd60932715c7ef95b38f2.poster.avif?t=1789673918\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949950/extras/8d5b298df66fd60932715c7ef95b38f2.webm?t=1789673918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949950/extras/8d5b298df66fd60932715c7ef95b38f2.mp4?t=1789673918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949950/extras/e1f22c96b151621bf40c2ca2e656dd8b.poster.avif?t=1789673918\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949950/extras/e1f22c96b151621bf40c2ca2e656dd8b.webm?t=1789673918\" type=\"